### ========================================
### ROUND TRIP & PASSENGER TYPE FEATURES
### ========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. SEARCH FLIGHTS - By City Name and Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ScheduledFlights/search?origin=New York&destination=London&departure=2024-12-25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. SEARCH FLIGHTS - By Airport Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ScheduledFlights/search?origin=JFK&destination=LHR&departure=2024-12-25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. SEARCH FLIGHTS - By Route (using airport IDs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ScheduledFlights/by-route?originId=1&destinationId=2&date=2024-12-25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. CALCULATE PRICE - One Way with Adult, Child, Infant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ScheduledFlights/calculate-price
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "flightId": 1,
  "passengers": [
    {
      "passengerType": "Adult",
      "seatClass": "Economy",
      "seatNumber": "12A"
    },
    {
      "passengerType": "Child",
      "seatClass": "Economy",
      "seatNumber": "12B"
    },
    {
      "passengerType": "Infant",
      "seatClass": "Economy",
      "seatNumber": "12C"
    }
  ]
}

### 5. CALCULATE PRICE - Round Trip
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ScheduledFlights/calculate-price
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "flightId": 1,
  "returnFlightId": 2,
  "passengers": [
    {
      "passengerType": "Adult",
      "seatClass": "Business",
      "seatNumber": "1A"
    },
    {
      "passengerType": "Child",
      "seatClass": "Business",
      "seatNumber": "1B"
    }
  ]
}

### 6. CREATE BOOKING - One Way with Multiple Passengers
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "flightId": 1,
  "bookingType": "OneWay",
  "totalAmount": 15000,
  "passengers": [
    {
      "fullName": "John Doe",
      "age": 35,
      "gender": "Male",
      "passengerType": "Adult",
      "passportNumber": "A12345678",
      "seatNumber": "12A"
    },
    {
      "fullName": "Jane Doe",
      "age": 8,
      "gender": "Female",
      "passengerType": "Child",
      "passportNumber": "A87654321",
      "seatNumber": "12B"
    }
  ]
}

### 7. CREATE BOOKING - Round Trip
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "flightId": 1,
  "returnFlightId": 2,
  "bookingType": "RoundTrip",
  "totalAmount": 25000,
  "passengers": [
    {
      "fullName": "John Smith",
      "age": 40,
      "gender": "Male",
      "passengerType": "Adult",
      "passportNumber": "B12345678",
      "seatNumber": "5A"
    },
    {
      "fullName": "Emily Smith",
      "age": 10,
      "gender": "Female",
      "passengerType": "Child",
      "passportNumber": "B87654321",
      "seatNumber": "5B"
    },
    {
      "fullName": "Baby Smith",
      "age": 1,
      "gender": "Male",
      "passengerType": "Infant",
      "passportNumber": "B11111111",
      "seatNumber": "5C"
    }
  ]
}

### 8. GET MY BOOKINGS - View all bookings with round trip info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/my-bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. GET BOOKING BY ID - View specific booking details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### FEATURE SUMMARY
### ========================================
# ✅ Round Trip Support
#    - BookingType: OneWay, RoundTrip, MultiCity
#    - ReturnFlightId field for return flights
#    - Price calculation for both legs
#
# ✅ Passenger Type Selection
#    - Adult (full price)
#    - Child (25% discount by default)
#    - Infant (90% discount by default)
#
# ✅ Enhanced Search
#    - Search by city name (origin/destination)
#    - Search by airport code
#    - Search by date
#    - Search by flight number
#    - Search by status
